WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

01:37.264 --> 01:40.364
It's perfect. Excellent work, Sayaka.

01:40.364 --> 01:41.794
Thank you very much.

01:43.034 --> 01:47.664
With this, there's hope it will be approved
by the Council, Madam President.

01:47.934 --> 01:49.764
At last.

01:50.404 --> 01:54.374
It seems people just can't rid themselves
of their antagonism toward the Moon.

01:54.374 --> 01:54.614
Proposal for Joint
Earth Federation/Sphere Kingdom
Space Station Program

01:54.614 --> 01:57.744
Proposal for Joint
Earth Federation/Sphere Kingdom
Space Station Program
That being said, the people of the Moon
are no different.

01:57.744 --> 02:01.814
Proposal for Joint
Earth Federation/Sphere Kingdom
Space Station Program
The space station program has stalled,
neither side able to compromise.

02:01.814 --> 02:04.254
If only Sefiria were here...

02:04.624 --> 02:08.724
"If both sides walks half a step,
that becomes one step forward."

02:08.724 --> 02:09.654
Is that how it went?

02:09.654 --> 02:12.294
That's my ever-so-talented secretary for you.

02:12.294 --> 02:15.854
Excellent job remembering
that old speech of hers!

02:17.134 --> 02:22.734
Back then, I was Minister of Foreign Affairs
and she and I clashed from our first meeting.

02:22.734 --> 02:26.674
I heard that you had a vocal disagreement
at some private location as well.

02:26.674 --> 02:31.444
We were friends! So naturally,
we had our share of heated arguments.

02:32.984 --> 02:36.284
She left us far too early...

02:36.454 --> 02:42.324
But Miss Sefiria left us a glimmer of hope.

02:42.324 --> 02:47.784
Yes, a certain very wise princess.
How is she coming along?

02:47.894 --> 02:53.634
She has an appetite for learning,
and experiences something new every day.

02:53.634 --> 02:56.404
Tatsuya and the others are
doing their best to help as well.

02:56.574 --> 03:02.114
Princess Feena, Tatsuya and Mai
are all like grandchildren to me!

03:02.114 --> 03:05.914
Entrusting her to you, whom I think of
as my daughter, was the right choice!

03:07.784 --> 03:12.744
I see. Princess Feena and the others
are grandchildren, but I'm a daughter?

03:17.494 --> 03:19.924
I-it's nice weather today!

03:19.924 --> 03:21.894
Is it?

03:21.894 --> 03:23.334
- Episode 4-
Fight, O Princess!

03:23.334 --> 03:25.834
- Episode 4-
Fight, O Princess!
Fight, O Princess!

03:25.834 --> 03:27.864
- Episode 4-
Fight, O Princess!

03:33.044 --> 03:36.984
Tatsuya, the river's water is warmer
than it was last time.

03:36.984 --> 03:38.884
Because it's almost summer.

03:38.884 --> 03:40.874
Soon it'll be warm enough to swim in!

03:41.254 --> 03:46.854
When we were kids, you and I played here a lot
instead of going to a pool, right?

03:46.854 --> 03:48.894
Yeah, with Jin and Mai.

03:48.894 --> 03:50.264
It sounds like fun.

03:50.264 --> 03:53.194
This summer, I'd like to be able
to play with you as well.

03:53.194 --> 03:58.934
Th-this was when we were kids!
It'd be embarrassing to swim in a river now!

03:58.934 --> 03:59.964
It would?

03:59.964 --> 04:01.934
That's Feena for you...

04:01.934 --> 04:06.104
Anyway, you know how to swim? Even though
you were raised on the Moon. Incredible!

04:07.544 --> 04:09.344
Um, well...

04:10.444 --> 04:13.314
Looks like someone couldn't wait.
They're swimming.

04:17.524 --> 04:19.784
They're not swimming, they're drowning!

04:20.524 --> 04:21.854
Luna!

04:22.024 --> 04:24.354
Luna, wait!

04:25.894 --> 04:27.124
Feena!

04:36.774 --> 04:38.304
Tatsuya...

04:38.304 --> 04:39.504
Could it be?

04:42.674 --> 04:44.884
I knew it! She can't swim!

04:44.884 --> 04:47.174
Someone! Anyone!

04:49.184 --> 04:50.624
What's wrong?

04:50.624 --> 04:52.644
It looks like a girl jumped into the water!

04:54.324 --> 04:57.054
Oh, no! There's a waterfall
at the head of the river!

05:02.194 --> 05:06.304
I thought that scream sounded familiar.
As I suspected, it's my lovely sister.

05:06.304 --> 05:08.134
What's happened here?

05:08.134 --> 05:11.194
Big Brother! You came just in time!

05:11.974 --> 05:14.074
Brother, help us!

05:14.074 --> 05:15.634
To do what?!

05:21.354 --> 05:22.714
Over there!

05:22.714 --> 05:23.774
Feena!

05:25.654 --> 05:28.784
My foot hurts!

05:30.794 --> 05:32.854
Niagara!

05:34.834 --> 05:37.034
It looks like she swallowed a lot of water.

05:37.034 --> 05:39.224
In a case like this...

05:39.834 --> 05:42.074
Mouth-to-mouth, huh?

05:42.074 --> 05:43.474
Natsuki, please!

05:43.474 --> 05:45.474
Huh? M-me?

05:45.474 --> 05:47.674
You're both girls, so it shouldn't
be a problem, right?

05:47.944 --> 05:50.814
I guess you're right, but...

06:01.554 --> 06:02.614
Why now of all times?!

06:06.464 --> 06:07.194
I'm sorry!

06:19.644 --> 06:20.734
Where's the puppy?!

06:26.414 --> 06:28.954
I'm so glad! You're all right, aren't you?

06:28.954 --> 06:30.684
Thanks to your help.

06:31.624 --> 06:32.724
I'm sorry...

06:32.724 --> 06:34.654
No, it's okay.

06:34.654 --> 06:35.554
Luna!

06:39.394 --> 06:40.724
Luna!

06:41.164 --> 06:44.434
Thank goodness! Thank goodness, Luna!

06:44.434 --> 06:46.264
Thank you so much!

06:46.264 --> 06:48.804
Huh? But I...

06:48.804 --> 06:50.944
No doubt about it, Feena.

06:50.944 --> 06:52.564
You were the one who saved that puppy.

06:53.644 --> 06:54.874
Tatsuya...

06:55.574 --> 06:57.144
Thank you!

06:57.144 --> 06:58.614
Bye bye!

07:00.784 --> 07:05.554
But Feena... Why did you do that
if you couldn't swim?

07:05.554 --> 07:09.014
The nobility is supported by the people.

07:09.254 --> 07:15.164
And as a member of the nobility,
I cannot ignore when the people need help.

07:15.794 --> 07:21.294
But that girl's an Earthling. She doesn't
have anything to do with the Moon.

07:23.204 --> 07:27.574
I didn't even think about it.
My body moved of its own volition.

07:28.474 --> 07:29.844
That's just like you, Feena!

07:29.844 --> 07:32.284
It certainly is, but...

07:32.284 --> 07:33.244
Tatsuya?

07:33.244 --> 07:36.814
Ah, it's just, if something were to
happen to their monarch,

07:36.814 --> 07:39.284
who would protect the people?

07:40.594 --> 07:44.364
I mean, if the monarch they're meant
to support is no longer around,

07:44.364 --> 07:48.624
the people would be even more troubled,
and probably become anxious.

07:48.794 --> 07:51.354
Tatsuya, this isn't the time
to say something like...

07:52.964 --> 07:58.874
Tatsuya's right. As a member of the royal family,
my actions were imprudent.

07:59.074 --> 08:05.014
Um, in times like that, I think it might be best
to rely on those around you.

08:06.484 --> 08:12.684
Feena, you can do everything yourself,
but it's sure to be a burden, so...

08:15.354 --> 08:17.154
Sorry for sounding presumptuous!

08:18.524 --> 08:21.424
That's fine. I still have a long way to go.

08:26.104 --> 08:27.734
We're home.

08:27.734 --> 08:29.804
P-Princess, your appearance!

08:29.804 --> 08:31.204
Brother?!

08:31.204 --> 08:32.934
We're fine, both of us.

08:33.444 --> 08:35.434
Oh! So you're back, young'un.

08:36.644 --> 08:40.414
You can't surprise me by popping up
out of nowhere anymore,

08:40.414 --> 08:42.904
but what on Earth are you doing in my room?!

08:44.124 --> 08:46.884
Checkin' some footage I shot!

08:46.884 --> 08:48.584
Fine, I guess that's all right...

08:50.194 --> 08:51.454
I'm sorry!

08:54.264 --> 08:56.324
What do you think you're filming?!

08:56.664 --> 08:58.934
If you were there, you should've helped us!

08:58.934 --> 09:04.034
Don't be ridiculous! If I'd lent a hand,
there'd be no documentary!

09:05.304 --> 09:07.704
Anyway, lemme show you somethin' good.

09:08.414 --> 09:10.344
Staff! Get IT out!

09:10.344 --> 09:11.434
Yes, Boss!

09:11.644 --> 09:12.844
Hyaa!

09:14.684 --> 09:16.784
I can't really see anything...

09:16.784 --> 09:19.084
Huh?! This is...

09:19.224 --> 09:20.524
Don't tell me!

09:20.524 --> 09:22.754
I've been followin' her since she was little...

09:22.754 --> 09:26.054
and she certainly has gotten big,
our Miss Feena!

09:26.924 --> 09:28.834
Hello, my sister!

09:28.834 --> 09:29.294
Get out!
Hello, my sister!

09:29.294 --> 09:30.234
Get out!
Your back could use a wash-

09:30.964 --> 09:33.064
Ah, how moving...

09:33.064 --> 09:35.074
You call this a documentary?!

09:35.074 --> 09:38.804
Mai and those others have nothing to do with it!
Why are you filming Natsuki from next door?!

09:38.804 --> 09:40.974
I am a perfectionist.

09:40.974 --> 09:42.944
That's not what this is about!

09:42.944 --> 09:44.944
Brother, the bath is free.

09:44.944 --> 09:47.684
I swear, what are you doing dressed like that?

09:47.684 --> 09:52.054
Mai! Okay! I'll be out soon,
just don't come any closer!

09:53.284 --> 09:56.654
What's with the attitude?
And you're all flustered...

09:56.654 --> 09:57.094
Just what are you watching...

09:57.094 --> 09:57.894
Have a seat!
Just what are you watching...

09:57.894 --> 09:58.154
Just what are you watching...

09:59.764 --> 10:01.434
Brother, you pervert!

10:01.434 --> 10:02.994
You've got it all wrong!

10:02.994 --> 10:04.624
What's wrong, Tatsuya?

10:09.474 --> 10:11.574
Oh, my sister!

10:11.574 --> 10:15.714
We are siblings of the same blood.
There's nothing to be embarrassed about!

10:15.714 --> 10:16.604
Stay back!

10:18.714 --> 10:23.284
Tatsuya, just what is this footage?
And why are you dressed like that?

10:23.284 --> 10:26.084
Mr. Tatsuya, we trusted you!

10:26.084 --> 10:29.924
I was in the middle of changing!
Anyway, it was Mr. Takano who...

10:30.724 --> 10:31.924
They're gone!

10:32.194 --> 10:33.194
Brother!

10:33.194 --> 10:34.434
Mr. Tatsuya!

10:34.434 --> 10:35.794
Tatsuya!

10:45.304 --> 10:47.574
Um, Brother?

10:47.574 --> 10:48.674
Tatsuya...

10:48.674 --> 10:49.904
Mr. Tatsuya...

10:54.184 --> 10:56.514
You know it was a misunderstanding
now, so it's fine.

10:56.514 --> 10:59.544
Also, everything else aside, I did watch it...

11:02.154 --> 11:05.094
That Mr. Takano really is a handful.

11:05.094 --> 11:09.134
I'm so embarrassed! Something like that
happening without us even knowing...

11:09.134 --> 11:15.074
It's all right. Mr. Takano should be getting rid
of that footage by now.

11:15.374 --> 11:17.564
That certainly is understanding of him.

11:17.804 --> 11:21.244
He has no ulterior motives at all.

11:21.244 --> 11:25.544
He cares only about to what extent
his footage is enjoyable.

11:26.114 --> 11:30.214
It seems he's taken a liking to you.
That's why he enjoys upsetting you.

11:30.214 --> 11:33.954
I swear. I'll have to be a bit careful from now on.

11:33.954 --> 11:39.794
Mia, let me know right away if you notice
anything strange while you're cleaning.

11:39.794 --> 11:41.694
Just leave it to me!

11:42.964 --> 11:46.834
Ah, actually, there is something
that's been bothering me for a while.

11:47.674 --> 11:51.004
There's a door on the second floor
that just won't open.

11:51.004 --> 11:52.944
I'd like to clean in there too.

11:54.014 --> 11:55.944
What should we do?

11:55.944 --> 12:00.174
This could be the right opportunity.
It's not as if we'd planned on hiding it.

12:04.924 --> 12:07.084
Welcome to my dad's study.

12:18.934 --> 12:20.594
Just what is this room?

12:20.734 --> 12:25.904
Sorry. Our dad was always bringing things home
but never really cleaned up.

12:26.244 --> 12:29.544
As I recall, your father is...

12:29.544 --> 12:32.614
Chiharu Asagiri, archaeologist.

12:32.614 --> 12:34.884
Or maybe that's going too far.

12:34.884 --> 12:36.254
He's more of a generalist,

12:36.254 --> 12:39.914
unable to rest unless he studies anything
and everything that catches his eye.

12:41.054 --> 12:43.724
What is that?! A p-p-person's!

12:43.724 --> 12:45.884
I think this is...

12:47.224 --> 12:49.194
A mummified Kappa arm!

12:50.964 --> 12:54.434
"There are many things in this world
that remain unknown."

12:54.434 --> 12:56.764
That's my dad's catchphrase.

12:57.104 --> 13:02.444
He hardly ever comes home, but the tales
of his adventures are really interesting!

13:24.364 --> 13:26.664
You think you can catch up to me at that pace?!

13:34.644 --> 13:37.214
H-he sounds like a wonderful father.

13:37.214 --> 13:39.044
And where is he now?

13:39.844 --> 13:41.154
Where do you think he is, Mai?

13:41.154 --> 13:43.454
The last time we saw him,

13:43.454 --> 13:46.754
he was investigating some ruins
left behind by aliens, right?

13:46.754 --> 13:50.924
Then maybe he got snatched up by a UFO
and is on a space voyage right now, huh?

13:51.624 --> 13:53.094
Could be!

13:56.334 --> 13:59.494
I will expose this alien secret!

14:04.204 --> 14:07.434
Stop it! Aliens! I'll tear you a new one!

14:10.044 --> 14:11.814
I bet it's something like that.

14:11.814 --> 14:14.784
He's not the type to die so easily.

14:14.784 --> 14:16.854
Just when we've forgotten about him,
he always comes back.

14:16.854 --> 14:20.584
Also, he was the first Earthling
to study on the Moon.

14:20.584 --> 14:25.754
What? But Sayaka and the others were the first
to be accepted as students on the Moon.

14:26.124 --> 14:27.494
Officially, yes.

14:27.494 --> 14:31.504
After all, my father had been making secret trips
to the Moon since he was young.

14:31.504 --> 14:32.664
Secret trips?!

14:32.664 --> 14:38.264
He forged some documents and apparently
bluffed his way into a lunar university.

14:38.474 --> 14:41.514
It's amazing it didn't become
an interplanetary issue.

14:41.514 --> 14:44.774
As it turns out, his cover was soon blown
and he was deported.

14:44.884 --> 14:49.014
Neither the Earth nor the Moon could admit
such a ridiculous thing happened,

14:49.014 --> 14:51.084
so my dad was never publicly censured.

14:51.084 --> 14:53.414
Sayaka was the one who told me all this.

14:54.054 --> 14:55.954
He's an amazing person...

14:55.954 --> 14:57.114
Yeah.

14:57.424 --> 14:59.554
He really is one of a kind.

15:00.124 --> 15:06.864
I've always admired him, wanted to be brimming
with vitality like that... but it's pretty hard.

15:13.574 --> 15:16.204
You look up to your father, don't you?

15:16.474 --> 15:20.204
The same way you're trying to catch up to
Queen Sefiria, huh?

15:21.714 --> 15:22.444
Mr. Tatsuya!

15:23.214 --> 15:24.984
What is it, Mia?

15:24.984 --> 15:28.474
About this room... May I clean it?!

15:28.554 --> 15:31.364
Mia... Even though you were that frightened...

15:31.364 --> 15:33.884
Her desire to clean overcame her fear, eh?

15:34.064 --> 15:36.694
Okay, but it'll be a lot of work.

15:36.694 --> 15:40.034
That's fine! If anything, it gives
the cleaning more meaning!

15:47.174 --> 15:52.274
On the other hand, maybe there's no need
to clean up this room after all...

15:53.714 --> 15:56.354
I have no objections. Mia?

15:56.354 --> 15:58.914
I shall obey my princess!

16:11.404 --> 16:13.264
Don't push me!

16:18.574 --> 16:20.944
It's just as I'd seen in the literature.

16:20.944 --> 16:25.014
Emigrant by nature, its life being risked in the
process, yet its intrusion is not tolerated...

16:25.014 --> 16:27.574
That black, glistening, detestable bug!

16:27.754 --> 16:30.684
Tatsuya! We must depart from here at once!

16:34.354 --> 16:36.084
T-Tatsuya?

16:39.594 --> 16:42.094
Butterfly! Butterfly!

16:42.094 --> 16:46.964
Not black, not glistening, not oily, a butterfly!

16:47.734 --> 16:47.934
Mia?

16:47.934 --> 16:48.774
Wait up!
Mia?

16:48.774 --> 16:50.324
Mia! Where are you?

16:50.634 --> 16:51.674
Mia!

16:51.674 --> 16:52.874
Butterfly!

16:52.874 --> 16:54.174
Don't tell me...

16:56.644 --> 16:58.714
Yes, this is Karen.

16:58.714 --> 17:00.874
What's happened, Miss Feena?

17:00.984 --> 17:03.214
What did you just say?!

17:03.654 --> 17:07.484
What do you mean, "By the honor of the
royal family, fight till the very end"?

17:07.484 --> 17:07.694
Lai
Lai
Ken

17:07.694 --> 17:09.454
Lai
Lai
Ken
Miss Feena? Miss Feena!

17:12.764 --> 17:14.454
Butterfly! Butterfly!

17:24.844 --> 17:25.804
Mia...

17:27.174 --> 17:28.074
Mia!

17:29.614 --> 17:30.334
Mia!

17:31.714 --> 17:33.234
MIA!

18:09.714 --> 18:12.624
S-Staff! Retreat in three seconds!

18:12.624 --> 18:13.484
Yes, Boss!

18:15.894 --> 18:17.224
Mia!

18:19.464 --> 18:21.754
Mia? Where are you? Mia!

18:23.364 --> 18:24.294
Mia!

18:24.294 --> 18:25.594
Thank goodness you're all right!

18:50.324 --> 18:51.294
Mia!

18:52.864 --> 18:54.084
Mia!

18:55.294 --> 18:56.394
Madam Princess...

18:56.394 --> 18:57.734
Madam Princess!

18:57.734 --> 18:59.464
I'm glad you're okay, Mia.

19:02.404 --> 19:04.924
It's all right, Mia. Just watch.

19:13.044 --> 19:16.844
I am Princess Feena Fam Earthlight,
princess of Sphere Kingdom!

19:17.084 --> 19:22.354
Know that even if my body be overrun,
you shall not sully my prideful spirit!

19:26.594 --> 19:27.834
Madam Princess!

19:27.834 --> 19:28.794
Mia!

19:32.404 --> 19:34.204
Miss Feena. You're safe.

19:34.204 --> 19:35.474
Karen!

19:35.474 --> 19:37.064
Please get aboard.

19:44.484 --> 19:46.184
Karen, exterminate them!

19:46.184 --> 19:47.304
Understood.

19:47.384 --> 19:50.544
This affront to our leader
must be punished! Eat this!

19:57.494 --> 19:59.464
Move back! Move back!

20:03.964 --> 20:06.904
After a day at work, I come home, tired,

20:06.904 --> 20:10.464
to find that for some reason
Chiharu's study has been blown up...

20:10.704 --> 20:13.474
You know, that got me a little angry!

20:13.974 --> 20:15.674
Please listen, Sayaka.

20:15.674 --> 20:18.114
There is an important reason behind this.

20:18.114 --> 20:23.344
That's why I said I'd hear the whole story,
didn't I?! The night is young.

20:23.954 --> 20:26.024
Sitting like this hurts...

20:26.024 --> 20:29.144
Um, I really was scared...

20:30.354 --> 20:33.054
Butterfly! Butterfly!

20:33.394 --> 20:35.294
All right! No more needless chatter!

20:35.734 --> 20:37.724
Miss Sayaka, you're scaring me...

20:38.204 --> 20:41.104
That's because she usually never gets angry.

20:41.104 --> 20:45.344
I'm sorry. Because of me,
your father's study was...

20:45.344 --> 20:47.474
It's okay, don't worry about it.

20:47.474 --> 20:50.144
Actually, this might have helped
straighten up a bit.

20:50.144 --> 20:53.244
I've caused everyone such trouble...

20:53.244 --> 20:57.314
As a princess, and as a person,
I really do have a long way to go.

20:57.314 --> 21:00.514
It's because you always put too much
into whatever you're doing.

21:01.194 --> 21:03.484
As I thought, somebody needs to help you.

21:04.694 --> 21:08.284
Every once in a while,
you should rely on me. Okay?

21:08.534 --> 21:09.894
Tatsuya...

21:09.894 --> 21:13.394
Still, this time I was unconscious
for the whole thing...

21:14.774 --> 21:16.394
Thank you, Tatsuya.

21:16.674 --> 21:18.504
Okay you two,

21:18.504 --> 21:23.504
if you go laughing while I'm lecturing you,
this will never be over!

21:29.084 --> 21:30.884
Why did this happen to me?

21:32.324 --> 21:33.424
Father!

21:33.424 --> 21:37.354
You're missing work without excuse, Jin.
This is coming out of your pay!

21:38.094 --> 21:40.524
How incredibly without merit!

21:40.524 --> 21:43.584
This makes 13 months without pay!

21:45.604 --> 21:49.094
Let me hear more of that echo!

21:49.304 --> 21:51.604
Father, come back!

21:51.604 --> 21:54.134
And my pay, come back!

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
Platinum no mikazuki

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Ima funwari tatazunda

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
Sora miagete omou

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
Ano nagareboshi kitto tsuki no namida ne

22:39.554 --> 22:46.994
Soshite anata wo omotta

22:46.994 --> 22:55.104
Doushite watashi namida ga deru no

22:55.104 --> 23:03.014
Eien wo tada inotteiru noni

23:03.014 --> 23:11.014
Mirai wo shinji aruite itai

23:11.014 --> 23:23.264
Tsuki ga nankai michite wa kakete mo, anata to

23:25.164 --> 23:26.604
Preview

23:26.604 --> 23:28.674
Preview
For Mia, on her first time to see the ocean,

23:28.674 --> 23:28.804
For Mia, on her first time to see the ocean,

23:28.804 --> 23:30.174
I present this bathing suit
suitable even for scuba diving!

23:30.174 --> 23:31.344
Thank you very much.

23:31.344 --> 23:35.474
And writing "Mia Clementis" in big letters
on the name tag was so kind.

23:35.474 --> 23:36.674
My eyes are blinded by the light!
Someone throw me a line!

23:36.674 --> 23:38.184
